                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0a076e4-2556-342b-9f5f-e904805fc87a",
                                        "entry_id": "b663ffc7-4d7d-31ed-b4ef-9bae607a559d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is deducted; that which is subtracted or removed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "714e7e0e-9acf-4b9b-b0df-888f21b1816c",
                                                "sense_id": "b0a076e4-2556-342b-9f5f-e904805fc87a",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: extract, reduction; see also Thesaurus:decrement"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2c316c1-1747-3994-9cb6-b0bdae8379c5",
                                        "entry_id": "b663ffc7-4d7d-31ed-b4ef-9bae607a559d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is deducted; that which is subtracted or removed.",
                                            "A sum that can be removed in tax calculations, usually from the taxable amount; something that is written off."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17779153-1f54-44cd-acd5-31fe2dec90bf",
                                                "sense_id": "e2c316c1-1747-3994-9cb6-b0bdae8379c5",
                                                "text": "standard deduction"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26537412-dd65-46c7-b286-669153761296",
                                                "sense_id": "e2c316c1-1747-3994-9cb6-b0bdae8379c5",
                                                "text": "You might want to donate the old junk and just take the deduction."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "782e63bb-2a81-30ba-81b8-8892336d67e7",
                                        "entry_id": "b663ffc7-4d7d-31ed-b4ef-9bae607a559d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is deducted; that which is subtracted or removed.",
                                            "A sum withheld from an employee's pay for the purpose of paying tax."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90cdbe9f-a9b9-3e5d-b2a8-c81eb47a1b49",
                                        "entry_id": "b663ffc7-4d7d-31ed-b4ef-9bae607a559d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A process of reasoning that moves from the general to the specific, in which a conclusion follows necessarily from the premises presented, so that the conclusion cannot be false if the premises are true.",
                                            "A conclusion; that which is deduced, concluded or figured out"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb2c5811-742f-46df-aa6b-dfc79ba2bdfb",
                                                "sense_id": "90cdbe9f-a9b9-3e5d-b2a8-c81eb47a1b49",
                                                "text": "He arrived at the deduction that the butler didn't do it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8f9b31e-8ae7-46fa-89f8-c20649ef14c0",
                                                "sense_id": "90cdbe9f-a9b9-3e5d-b2a8-c81eb47a1b49",
                                                "text": "An unkinder deduction, considering only the Select Committee's report and discounting rumours of wayward conclusions by the Stedeford Group, would be that if one inquisition doesn't produce the desired answers, the Minister's policy is \"try, try again\"—or should one say \"fight, fight, fight again\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86da6f66-a609-37ef-a9fa-7e1eb77857ee",
                                        "entry_id": "b663ffc7-4d7d-31ed-b4ef-9bae607a559d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A process of reasoning that moves from the general to the specific, in which a conclusion follows necessarily from the premises presented, so that the conclusion cannot be false if the premises are true.",
                                            "The ability or skill to deduce or figure out; the power of reason"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "586d4ed5-3ad9-493d-92fc-3aef26b13e0d",
                                                "sense_id": "86da6f66-a609-37ef-a9fa-7e1eb77857ee",
                                                "text": "Through his powers of deduction, he realized that the plan would never work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4c0b7cb-d6cf-400e-a5ce-5ede8bba0712",
                        "source_entry_id": "30d2627a-784e-3f1a-a758-2769d1f9efb7",
                        "target_lang_word": "deducción",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deducción",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c73dda50-fa38-3479-beef-6ca8d96848e9",
                                        "entry_id": "8fb4cde9-ad2a-308a-9d6f-3541047dbeb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acción o efecto de deducir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0393cd28-958e-4478-8725-d50f570087b9",
                                                "sense_id": "c73dda50-fa38-3479-beef-6ca8d96848e9",
                                                "text": "Aunque en algunos Ejércitos pueden crearse G. U. inferiores a la División, como son las Brigadas Mixtas o Divisiones ligeras, en la composición de aquélla y en la deducción de sus propiedades nos referiremos al tipo de División ternaria más generalizado, sin perjuicio de referirnos oportunamente a la División ligera. El Cuerpo de Ejército. El Ejército y el Grupo de Ejércitos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dc96170-46c2-4ad7-bd26-4ef235c9156d",
                                                "sense_id": "c73dda50-fa38-3479-beef-6ca8d96848e9",
                                                "text": "Art. 63º.- Juicios sobre aplicación de beneficios conforme a la Ley N.º 4916 y modificatorias.- El honorario no podrá ser inferior al que resulte de aplicar la escala del art. 15.º con deducción del cincuenta por ciento (50%), si la remuneración-base para el cálculo de los beneficios no excede de diez mil soles oro (S/. 10,000.00); en caso contrario, la deducción será sólo de una tercera parte."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9f148aef-8636-4490-8ab4-86bc5d6bd3a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "30d2627a-784e-3f1a-a758-2769d1f9efb7",
                        "target_lang_word": "deduzione",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deduzione",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7bc4558-630f-32d3-be10-ad14c9f5b2da",
                                        "entry_id": "9a93da3a-5405-325d-af21-834e9741031c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "processo logico per cui da una premessa iniziale, attraverso una serie di passaggi logici necessari (inferenze), derivano determinate conclusioni. La deduzione è quindi il processo che permette il passaggio dal principio generale esposto nella premessa alla conclusione che conduce a fatti particolari."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a57f813-4142-3dc2-b314-ea6e640e922c",
                                        "entry_id": "9a93da3a-5405-325d-af21-834e9741031c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ragionamento che parte da concetti assunti per veri per giungere a conseguenze attraverso passaggi razionali"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba10c914-b4b7-4ca4-87f3-4229e3c0d6b2",
                                                "sense_id": "0a57f813-4142-3dc2-b314-ea6e640e922c",
                                                "text": "nei gialli di Agatha Christie la soluzione è raggiunta per deduzione"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0173a44-49b5-4808-97fc-dee539fa3145",
                                                "sense_id": "0a57f813-4142-3dc2-b314-ea6e640e922c",
                                                "text": "Einstein ebbe molte brillanti deduzioni"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97cc8f6f-b998-35cc-9e58-da1c2a11323e",
